name: Link Analysis claims showcase
tagline: "A seeded insurance-claims Link Analysis demo - a staged-accident ring behind one garage, one clinic and one lawyer, planted among 380 claimants and 520 claims, with benign look-alikes"
description: "The insurance (Special Investigations Unit) Link Analysis demo as a Space Template. Six synthetic feeds (claim, claim_party, policy, provider_bill, accident_location, provider_directory; one extract each in data/inbox, 18 months of claims, about 380 claimants, 25 providers, 520 claims) are landed by six Collectors and Pipelines. The claims_links Job folds them into ONE link Dataset (src, dst, kind, ts, amount, event_date, via) of seven link kinds; claims_policy_timing joins claims to policies. Planted stories (ground truth pinned by LaClaimsGoldenTest; tools/gen-la-claims-data.py): 12 claimants over 9 claims share 4 phones and 3 addresses and use one garage, one clinic and one lawyer; one of them is a passenger on 6 claims with 6 different drivers; 11 accidents at 02:00-04:00 within 400 m of one junction, none with a police report; the ring's clinic bills about 3x its peers and is referred to only by the ring's lawyer; 7 policies claimed on within 20 days of inception, all via one broker; two claimant records that are one person (resolvable by identity resolution); and benign look-alikes (a family of four sharing a phone and address, a busy general-practice clinic) that must not join the ring. Settings: link-analysis.toon (masking typed with one masked Entity Type party, a four-eyes fan-out threshold, the link index ON, Drafts limits). Jobs: la_index_build (after claims_links is produced) and la_detect (every 5 minutes). Three saved views and three saved Geo Views. Demo Users and roles (roles.toon, demo-users.toon): siu.analyst (lead), siu.manager (second approver), partner.reviewer (read-only), outsider (not a member), admin (reveal). Investigations, members, Entity Lists, identity groups, external references and a Case are runtime state: run `node tools/seed-la-claims.mjs --apply`; the 12-minute walk-through is docs/ops/la-showcase-claims-runbook.md. Needs an Advanced or Preview edition build with Demo Auth (serve-demo). Synthetic data only."
minEdition: advanced
icon: heroicons_outline:shield-check
contents[9]: "6 Collectors + Pipelines + Datasets (one extract each)", "claims_links Job + Dataset (7 link kinds, event_date, via)", "claims_policy_timing Job + Dataset", "link-analysis.toon (masking typed, four-eyes, index ON, Drafts)", "la_index_build Job (on claims_links produced)", "la_detect Job (cron)", "3 saved views", "3 saved Geo Views + 2 virtual accident Datasets", "5 Demo Users + role table"
